 see why a GlobalId would have more than 1 SPkey.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"markdown-block\"><div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:20px;\">\n\n  \n<p>  <input style=\"padding:10px; border:2px solid green; border-radius:8px;\" placeholder=\"GlobalID\"></p>\n  \n  <div style=\"font-size:24px;\">\u2192</div>\n\n  \n  <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px;\">\n    <input style=\"padding:10px; border:2px solid blue; border-radius:8px;\" placeholder=\"CW|XXXX\">\n    <input style=\"padding:10px; border:2px solid blue; border-radius:8px;\" placeholder=\"CP|XXXX\">\n    <input style=\"padding:10px; border:2px solid blue; border-radius:8px;\" placeholder=\"OG|XXXX\">\n  </div>\n\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"markdown-block\"><h2 id=\"globalids-that-are-null\">GlobalIDs that are null?</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-wrapper\">\n  \n</div>\n<div class=\"cell cell-sql\" data-index=\"20\" data-collapse-state=\"collapsed\">\n  <div class=\"cell-header\"><span class=\"cell-badge\"><svg class=\"cell-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"#5d6a85\"><use href=\"#icon-lang-sql\"/></svg>SQL</span><span class=\"cell-name\">Pull a table with only null GlobalIds for 2026</span><span class=\"cell-counter\">[84]</span><div class=\"cell-menu-wrapper\">\n  <button class=\"cell-menu-btn\" onclick=\"toggleCellMenu(this)\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    <span class=\"cs-icon cs-expanded\"><svg class=\"collapse-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"#5d6a85\"><use href=\"#icon-expand\"/></svg></span>\n    <span class=\"cs-icon cs-code-only\"><svg class=\"collapse-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"#5d6a85\"><use href=\"#icon-code-only\"/></svg></span>\n    <span class=\"cs-icon cs-results-only\"><svg class=\"collapse-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"#5d6a85\"><use href=\"#icon-results-only\"/></svg></span>\n    <span class=\"cs-icon cs-collapsed\"><svg class=\"collapse-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"#5d6a85\"><use href=\"#icon-collapsed\"/></svg></span>\n  </button>\n  <div class=\"cell-menu\" hidden>\n    <button class=\"cell-menu-item\" onclick=\"setCellState(this,'expanded')\"><svg class=\"collapse-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"#5d6a85\"><use href=\"#icon-expand\"/></svg><span>Code and results</span></button>\n    <button class=\"cell-menu-item\" onclick=\"setCellState(this,'code-only')\"><svg class=\"collapse-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"#5d6a85\"><use href=\"#icon-code-only\"/></svg><span>Code only</span></button>\n    <button class=\"cell-menu-item\" onclick=\"setCellState(this,'results-only')\"><svg class=\"collapse-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"#5d6a85\"><use href=\"#icon-results-only\"/></svg><span>Results only</span></button>\n    <button class=\"cell-menu-item\" onclick=\"setCellState(this,'collapsed')\"><svg class=\"collapse-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"#5d6a85\"><use href=\"#icon-collapsed\"/></svg><span>Collapsed</span></button>\n  </div>\n</div></div>\n  <div class=\"cell-input cell-status-success\"><div class=\"cell-source\"><pre><code class=\"language-sql\"><span class=\"tok-keyword\">SELECT</span> \n    b.<span class=\"tok-string2\">&quot;AttendanceGroupCategoryDescription&quot;</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">,</span>\n    b.<span class=\"tok-string2\">&quot;AttendanceGroupSubCategoryDescription&quot;</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">,</span>\n    b.<span class=\"tok-string2\">&quot;AttendanceGroupSubCategoryName&quot;</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">,</span>\n    b.<span class=\"tok-string2\">&quot;ReportableSP&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"tok-keyword\">FROM</span> ORGDATACLOUD$INTERNAL$PROD_CONSUMPTION_CDP_LISTING.CDP.CDP_FACT_SALES a \n<span class=\"tok-keyword\">JOIN</span> ORGDATACLOUD$INTERNAL$PROD_CONSUMPTION_CDP_LISTING.CDP.CDP_DIM_PRODUCTS b \n    <span class=\"tok-keyword\">ON</span> a.<span class=\"tok-string2\">&quot;ProductKey&quot;</span> <span class=